{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If visible object, move to it and grab it, check properties, do specific task. Or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />",
